<div class="page">
  <div class="two-column">
    <div class="column" style="flex: 1;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;">Membership Renewal</h3>
      <p>All members should have received a letter from the Guild in April, along with a Membership Renewal Card. We want to thank those of you who have returned your card and your membership donation.</p>
      <p>If you have not yet sent in your renewal card, you may complete the copy shown here. Return it with your gift to:</p>
      <p>The Guild, HBU</p>
      <p><span data-field="address_line_1">{{ address_line_1 }}</span></p>
      <p><span data-field="city_state_zip">{{ city_state_zip }}</span></p>
      <p>You may use a check or credit card. Make checks payable to "The Guild, HBU." Be sure to complete all items on the form. Committees are being formed, and we need to know your interests. We also need the names of all renewing members in order to include them in our 2014-2015 Yearbook.</p>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">
        <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="The Guild Logo" style="max-width: 200px;">
        <h4 style="margin-top: 10px;">The Guild Membership Renewal Form</h4>
        <p>All information should be completed.</p>
      </div>
